{"displayStem":"정상 이배체 배양세포를 고정·RNase 처리한 뒤 DNA 염색을 측정했다. 파편과 이중체를 제외한 1000개 싱글렛을 같은 폭 구간으로 집계하였다. 2C와 4C 표지는 정상 이배체 대조로 보정하였다. 자료는 합성값이며 독립 반복·오차막대·통계적 유의성을 나타내지 않는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 합성자료 · 같은 폭의 DNA 함량 구간별 사건 수를 표시하였다.","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C03 c03-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><figure class=\"c03p5-plot\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 합성 관찰값 비교 그래프\"><rect width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"white\"></rect><path d=\"M70 90V320H550\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"62\" y=\"326\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"end\">250</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"end\">500</text><path d=\"M142 320v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"142\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2C</text><path d=\"M310 320v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"310\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3C</text><path d=\"M478 320v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"478\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4C</text><text x=\"78\" y=\"75\">사건 수</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"388\" text-anchor=\"middle\">DNA 함량 (C)</text><rect x=\"85\" y=\"12\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"123\" y=\"30\">가</text><rect x=\"79\" y=\"311.2\" width=\"42\" height=\"8.800000000000011\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"100\" y=\"304.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><rect x=\"121\" y=\"130.8\" width=\"42\" height=\"189.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"142\" y=\"123.80000000000001\" text-anchor=\"middle\">430</text><rect x=\"163\" y=\"293.6\" width=\"42\" height=\"26.399999999999977\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"184\" y=\"286.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><rect x=\"205\" y=\"306.8\" width=\"42\" height=\"13.199999999999989\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"226\" y=\"299.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><rect x=\"247\" y=\"306.8\" width=\"42\" height=\"13.199999999999989\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"268\" y=\"299.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><rect x=\"289\" y=\"304.6\" width=\"42\" height=\"15.399999999999977\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"310\" y=\"297.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">35</text><rect x=\"331\" y=\"306.8\" width=\"42\" height=\"13.199999999999989\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"352\" y=\"299.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><rect x=\"373\" y=\"304.6\" width=\"42\" height=\"15.399999999999977\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"394\" y=\"297.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">35</text><rect x=\"415\" y=\"300.2\" width=\"42\" height=\"19.80000000000001\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"436\" y=\"293.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\">45</text><rect x=\"457\" y=\"205.6\" width=\"42\" height=\"114.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"478\" y=\"198.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">260</text><rect x=\"499\" y=\"309\" width=\"42\" height=\"11\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"520\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25</text></svg></figure></div></div>"]}